    "Removing a source moves its photos to Recently Deleted, where they wait 30 days. The folder, its files and Apple Photos are not touched." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn du eine Quelle entfernst, kommen ihre Fotos 30 Tage lang in „Zuletzt gelöscht“. Der Ordner, seine Dateien und Apple Fotos bleiben unverändert."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Removing a source moves its photos to Recently Deleted, where they wait 30 days. The folder, its files and Apple Photos are not touched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "移除一个来源会把其中的照片移到“最近删除”，保留 30 天。文件夹、其中的文件和“照片”App 都不会有任何改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their notes and memories go with them, and this can't be undone. Your original files on this Mac and in Apple Photos are not touched." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notizen und Erinnerungen dazu werden mitgelöscht, und das lässt sich nicht widerrufen. Deine Originaldateien auf diesem Mac und in Apple Fotos bleiben unverändert."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Their notes and memories go with them, and this can't be undone. Your original files on this Mac and in Apple Photos are not touched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "照片上的备注和回忆会一并删除，且无法撤销。这台 Mac 上的原始文件和“照片”App 里的照片不会有任何改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They stay in Recently Deleted for 30 days. Your original files on this Mac and in Apple Photos are not touched." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sie bleiben 30 Tage in „Zuletzt gelöscht“. Deine Originaldateien auf diesem Mac und in Apple Fotos bleiben unverändert."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
