          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把还没有名字的地点重新查一遍名字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Regroups trips, long stays, frequent places and big days by the latest rules." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gruppiert Reisen, längere Aufenthalte, häufige Orte und große Tage nach den neuesten Regeln neu."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Regroups trips, long stays, frequent places and big days by the latest rules."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按最新规则把旅程、长住、常去地点和大日子重新分一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you confirmed on each page stays: named people, chapters you changed, stacks you split." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Was du auf jeder Seite bestätigt hast, bleibt: benannte Personen, geänderte Kapitel, getrennte Stapel."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What you confirmed on each page stays: named people, chapters you changed, stacks you split."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不会动：各页你确定过的内容（起过名字的人、改过的篇章、手动拆开的连拍等）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Named people and faces you confirmed stay, and so do your yes/no answers. Hidden people, skipped questions and loose faces are regrouped." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Benannte Personen, bestätigte Gesichter und deine Ja/Nein-Antworten bleiben. Ausgeblendete Personen, übersprungene Fragen und einzelne Gesichter werden neu gruppiert."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Named people and faces you confirmed stay, and so do your yes/no answers. Hidden people, skipped questions and loose faces are regrouped."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不会动：起过名字的人和你确认过的脸、答过「是/不是」的两组。隐藏的人、先跳过的问题、零散的脸会重新整理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Place names you typed stay as they are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ortsnamen, die du eingegeben hast, bleiben."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Place names you typed stay as they are."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不会动：你手动改过的地点名字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chapters you renamed, adjusted, or gave a cover or memory stay, and so do photos you moved by hand. Big days you deleted are considered again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kapitel, die du umbenannt, angepasst oder mit Titelbild oder Erinnerung versehen hast, bleiben, ebenso von Hand verschobene Fotos. Gelöschte große Tage werden erneut geprüft."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chapters you renamed, adjusted, or gave a cover or memory stay, and so do photos you moved by hand. Big days you deleted are considered again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不会动：改过名字、手动调整过、加过封面或回忆的篇章；手动放进或移出的照片。你删掉的大日子也会重新考虑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
