          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以后在旅程页上也能随时加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can look at the photos, write your own memories, keep favorites and rename places. Memories someone else wrote are read-only." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst die Fotos ansehen, eigene Erinnerungen schreiben, Favoriten setzen und Orte umbenennen. Erinnerungen anderer kannst du nur lesen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can look at the photos, write your own memories, keep favorites and rename places. Memories someone else wrote are read-only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以看照片、写自己的回忆、收藏、改地名。别人写的回忆只能看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your partner is removed and every shared trip disappears on their Mac. What they wrote stays on this Mac, and your photos and memories are not deleted. To record together again, send a new invitation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Partner wird entfernt und alle geteilten Reisen verschwinden auf seinem Mac. Was er geschrieben hat, bleibt auf diesem Mac, und deine Fotos und Erinnerungen werden nicht gelöscht. Um wieder gemeinsam festzuhalten, sende eine neue Einladung."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your partner is removed and every shared trip disappears on their Mac. What they wrote stays on this Mac, and your photos and memories are not deleted. To record together again, send a new invitation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对方会从共享里移出，所有共享的旅程在对方那边都会消失。对方写过的回忆会留在这台 Mac 上，你的照片和回忆不会被删。要再一起记录，需要重新邀请。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your partner joins by opening the link on their Mac, in Moments." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Partner tritt bei, indem er den Link auf seinem Mac in Moments öffnet."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your partner joins by opening the link on their Mac, in Moments."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对方在自己的 Mac 上点开链接、打开 Moments 就能加入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your partner will no longer see this trip's photos and memories. What your partner wrote stays on this Mac, and nothing of yours is deleted. You can share it again later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Partner sieht die Fotos und Erinnerungen dieser Reise nicht mehr. Was dein Partner geschrieben hat, bleibt auf diesem Mac, und von dir wird nichts gelöscht. Du kannst sie später wieder teilen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your partner will no longer see this trip's photos and memories. What your partner wrote stays on this Mac, and nothing of yours is deleted. You can share it again later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对方那边会看不到这段旅程的照片和回忆。对方写在这里的回忆会留在这台 Mac 上，你的东西都不会被删。以后可以再共享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
